    "note": "A robot that trains the timer\u2019s two robots. It teaches Ask on a box with the go pad in hole 6: ask the computer the time, answered to my readings, and move the pad to hole 7. Then it teaches Tell on a box with a reading and the pad in hole 7: put the reading in a [set | value | _] letter, give it to the bird on the perch, move the pad back, and have Ruby loosen the reading. Drop Tell on Ask and they take turns."
